{"title":"Career roadmap — Journalist","role":"Journalist","summary":"A Journalist researches, verifies, investigates and communicates news and public-interest information through newspapers, magazines, digital publications, television, radio, podcasts and other media platforms.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"English Literature"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For an English Literature graduate, the strongest advantage is language, reading, interpretation and storytelling. To become employable as a journalist, these must be combined with reporting, research, fact-checking, digital media, multimedia production, data literacy and journalistic ethics."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build reporting, writing, research, interviewing, fact-checking and multimedia skills; enter as Reporter/Editorial Intern/Journalism Associate."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Progress to Correspondent, Senior Reporter, Digital Journalist, Investigative Reporter or specialised beat reporter."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead reporting teams, investigations, editorial projects or specialised desks."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Progress toward Editor, Bureau Chief, Investigations Editor, Editorial Director or independent media entrepreneurship."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Literature + journalism foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Strengthen:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"English grammar"},{"text":"Vocabulary"},{"text":"Reading comprehension"},{"text":"Critical reading"},{"text":"Essay writing"},{"text":"Argument analysis"},{"text":"Research skills"},{"text":"Public speaking"},{"text":"Current affairs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn journalism fundamentals:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News values"},{"text":"5W1H"},{"text":"Inverted pyramid"},{"text":"Headlines"},{"text":"Leads"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Sources"},{"text":"Editorial independence"},{"text":"Media ethics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start reading multiple types of journalism every day:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"National news"},{"text":"International news"},{"text":"Business"},{"text":"Science"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Politics"},{"text":"Culture"},{"text":"Sports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Reporting + digital journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News reporting"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Source development"},{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Verification"},{"text":"Investigative research"},{"text":"Press conferences"},{"text":"Field reporting"},{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Opinion writing"},{"text":"Copy editing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn digital tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"WordPress/CMS"},{"text":"Google Docs"},{"text":"Basic SEO"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Audio recording"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Mobile journalism"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how to report for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Websites"},{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Magazines"},{"text":"Podcasts"},{"text":"YouTube"},{"text":"Social platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Specialisation + multimedia"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one or two beats."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible specialisations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Politics"},{"text":"Business"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Science"},{"text":"Health"},{"text":"Environment"},{"text":"Sports"},{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Law"},{"text":"International affairs"},{"text":"Culture"},{"text":"Entertainment"},{"text":"Investigative journalism"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data journalism"},{"text":"OSINT fundamentals"},{"text":"Public-record research"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Investigative reporting"},{"text":"Long-form journalism"},{"text":"Podcast journalism"},{"text":"Video journalism"},{"text":"Social-media journalism"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"AI-assisted research"},{"text":"Digital verification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Industry-ready journalism portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a portfolio containing:"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Investigative Story"},{"type":"p","text":"Research a public-interest issue using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Multiple sources"},{"text":"Documents"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Verification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Long-form Feature"},{"type":"p","text":"Produce a 1,500–3,000-word feature with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Original interviews"},{"text":"Background research"},{"text":"Narrative structure"},{"text":"Supporting evidence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Multimedia Story"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Written article"},{"text":"Short video"},{"text":"Audio/podcast component"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Beat Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Publish 10–20 well-researched articles around one specialised beat."},{"type":"p","text":"A journalist should graduate with published work, not just a degree."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Important skills","Potential roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Political Journalism"},{"text":"Policy, government, reporting"},{"text":"Political Reporter"}],[{"text":"Business Journalism"},{"text":"Finance, markets, economics"},{"text":"Business Reporter"}],[{"text":"Technology Journalism"},{"text":"Technology + research"},{"text":"Tech Journalist"}],[{"text":"Science Journalism"},{"text":"Scientific literacy"},{"text":"Science Journalist"}],[{"text":"Investigative Journalism"},{"text":"Research, verification"},{"text":"Investigative Reporter"}],[{"text":"Data Journalism"},{"text":"Data + reporting"},{"text":"Data Journalist"}],[{"text":"Sports Journalism"},{"text":"Sports knowledge, live reporting"},{"text":"Sports Journalist"}],[{"text":"Environmental Journalism"},{"text":"Climate, science"},{"text":"Environment Reporter"}],[{"text":"Health Journalism"},{"text":"Medical/scientific literacy"},{"text":"Health Reporter"}],[{"text":"Digital Journalism"},{"text":"CMS, SEO, multimedia"},{"text":"Digital Journalist"}],[{"text":"Broadcast Journalism"},{"text":"Video, presentation"},{"text":"TV Reporter"}],[{"text":"Audio Journalism"},{"text":"Podcasting, audio editing"},{"text":"Audio Journalist"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Best internship environments"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Digital newsrooms"},{"text":"Magazines"},{"text":"Television news channels"},{"text":"Radio organisations"},{"text":"News agencies"},{"text":"Investigative journalism organisations"},{"text":"Business publications"},{"text":"Technology publications"},{"text":"Local news organisations"},{"text":"Independent digital media"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship roles"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Editorial Intern"},{"text":"Reporting Intern"},{"text":"Digital Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Research Intern"},{"text":"Copy Editor Intern"},{"text":"Social Media Editorial Intern"},{"text":"Data Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Production Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What to learn"},{"type":"p","text":"During internships, gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newsroom meetings"},{"text":"Story pitching"},{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Source verification"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Headline writing"},{"text":"Publishing"},{"text":"Breaking-news workflows"},{"text":"Multimedia production"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The most valuable internship is one where the student gets published or contributes directly to the newsroom's reporting process."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Useful learning"],"rows":[[{"text":"Journalism"},{"text":"Journalism/reporting programmes"}],[{"text":"Digital Media"},{"text":"Digital journalism"}],[{"text":"Data Journalism"},{"text":"Data analysis + visualisation"}],[{"text":"Investigative Journalism"},{"text":"Investigative research"}],[{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Verification and misinformation research"}],[{"text":"Multimedia"},{"text":"Video/audio production"}],[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Digital publishing and SEO"}],[{"text":"OSINT"},{"text":"Open-source research and verification"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"AI-assisted journalism and verification"}],[{"text":"Media Law"},{"text":"Media ethics and legal fundamentals"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For journalism, published clips and demonstrated reporting ability are usually more valuable than certificates."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Reporter"},{"text":"Junior Reporter"},{"text":"Editorial Assistant"},{"text":"News Writer"},{"text":"Digital Journalist"},{"text":"Content Reporter"},{"text":"Researcher"},{"text":"Copy Editor"},{"text":"Editorial Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Reporter"},{"text":"Correspondent"},{"text":"Special Correspondent"},{"text":"Investigative Reporter"},{"text":"Feature Writer"},{"text":"Data Journalist"},{"text":"Political Correspondent"},{"text":"Business Correspondent"},{"text":"Technology Reporter"},{"text":"News Producer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Long-term"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Correspondent"},{"text":"Bureau Chief"},{"text":"Investigations Editor"},{"text":"News Editor"},{"text":"Managing Editor"},{"text":"Executive Editor"},{"text":"Editorial Director"},{"text":"Editor-in-Chief"},{"text":"Independent Journalist/Publisher"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG route","Best for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MA Journalism & Mass Communication"},{"text":"Professional journalism"}],[{"text":"MA Mass Communication"},{"text":"Broad media careers"}],[{"text":"MA English"},{"text":"Literature + academic/writing route"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma Journalism"},{"text":"Practical journalism"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma Digital Journalism"},{"text":"Digital newsroom"}],[{"text":"MA International Relations"},{"text":"Foreign affairs journalism"}],[{"text":"MA Economics/Finance"},{"text":"Business journalism"}],[{"text":"MA Political Science"},{"text":"Political journalism"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Data Journalism / Analytics-related study"},{"text":"Data journalism"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended route"},{"type":"p","text":"For general journalism:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA English Literature","Journalism Internship","Reporter","Correspondent","Senior Reporter","Editor"]},{"type":"p","text":"For specialised journalism:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA English Literature","Subject specialisation","Journalism training","Beat Reporter","Specialist Correspondent"]},{"type":"p","text":"For investigative journalism:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA English Literature","Journalism/Research Internship","Investigative Reporter","Senior Investigative Reporter","Investigations Editor"]}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Useful master's areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"🇬🇧 UK"},{"text":"Journalism, Investigative Journalism, Digital Journalism"}],[{"text":"🇺🇸 USA"},{"text":"Journalism, Data Journalism, Media Studies"}],[{"text":"🇨🇦 Canada"},{"text":"Journalism, Digital Media"}],[{"text":"🇦🇺 Australia"},{"text":"Journalism, Media & Communications"}],[{"text":"🇳🇱 Netherlands"},{"text":"Journalism, Media Studies"}],[{"text":"🇩🇪 Germany"},{"text":"Journalism, Media & Communication"}],[{"text":"🇸🇬 Singapore"},{"text":"Journalism, Communications"}],[{"text":"🇫🇷 France"},{"text":"Journalism, International Media"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For international journalism, specialise in an area such as international affairs, business, technology, climate or investigative reporting rather than remaining a generalist indefinitely."}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Newsroom pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reporter","Senior Reporter","Correspondent","Senior Correspondent","Bureau Chief / Desk Editor","News Editor","Managing Editor","Editor-in-Chief"]},{"type":"h","text":"Investigative pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reporter","Investigative Reporter","Senior Investigative Reporter","Investigations Editor","Investigations Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Journalist","Senior Digital Journalist","Digital Editor","Managing Digital Editor","Digital Editorial Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Independent pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reporter","Specialist Journalist","Newsletter/Podcast/Channel","Independent Publisher","Media Entrepreneur"]},{"type":"note","label":"Emerging specialisations","text":"2030–2040"},{"type":"h","text":"1. AI-Assisted Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Document analysis"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Research organisation"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Headline suggestions"},{"text":"Summarisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But journalists must independently verify facts and sources. AI-generated claims should never be treated as evidence without verification."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Data Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Journalists who can combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reporting","statistics","data","visualisation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"will become increasingly valuable."},{"type":"p","text":"Important areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public datasets"},{"text":"Election data"},{"text":"Corporate data"},{"text":"Economic indicators"},{"text":"Climate data"},{"text":"Government records"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Investigative Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Technology will make it easier to analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Large document collections"},{"text":"Corporate records"},{"text":"Public databases"},{"text":"Financial information"},{"text":"Digital footprints"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Human investigative judgement remains essential."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Creator-Led Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Journalists increasingly operate across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News websites"},{"text":"YouTube"},{"text":"Podcasts"},{"text":"Newsletters"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Communities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The journalist may become both reporter and media creator."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Verification Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Misinformation, manipulated media and AI-generated content will increase demand for specialists in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Digital verification"},{"text":"OSINT"},{"text":"Source authentication"},{"text":"Image/video verification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Specialised Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term niches are likely to include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI and technology"},{"text":"Climate"},{"text":"Science"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Business"},{"text":"Geopolitics"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Financial markets"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Routine content production will increasingly be assisted by AI:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic news summaries"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Data extraction"},{"text":"Commodity reports"},{"text":"Routine sports/business updates"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Human journalists will become more valuable for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Original reporting"},{"text":"Investigations"},{"text":"Exclusive interviews"},{"text":"Source relationships"},{"text":"Context"},{"text":"Accountability journalism"},{"text":"Complex analysis"},{"text":"Field reporting"},{"text":"Ethical judgement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The career therefore evolves from:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Writing news stories.\""},{"type":"p","text":"toward:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Discovering, verifying and explaining information that audiences cannot easily obtain or understand themselves.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Journalism"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"News writing"},{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Investigative journalism"},{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Source development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"English"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grammar"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Critical reading"},{"text":"Clear writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CMS"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Video"},{"text":"Audio"},{"text":"Mobile journalism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Data journalism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OSINT"},{"text":"Public records"},{"text":"Document analysis"},{"text":"Source verification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted research"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Verification tools"},{"text":"Generative AI literacy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Media law awareness"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Deadline management"},{"text":"Editorial judgement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["English","Current Affairs","Journalism Fundamentals"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 1"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reporting","Interviewing","Digital Journalism"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 2"},{"type":"flow","items":["Specialised Beat","Data/Investigative Skills","Multimedia"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 3"},{"type":"note","label":"Final Year","text":"Journalism internship + 15–20 published-quality articles"},{"type":"note","label":"0–2 years","text":"Reporter / Editorial Associate / Digital Journalist"},{"type":"note","label":"3–5 years","text":"Senior Reporter / Correspondent / Specialist Journalist"},{"type":"note","label":"5–8 years","text":"Senior Correspondent / Bureau Chief / Editor"},{"type":"note","label":"8–15 years","text":"Managing Editor / Editorial Director / Independent Media Founder"},{"type":"h","text":"Best employability combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA English Literature","journalism training","strong writing","reporting","interviewing","fact-checking","digital media","data literacy","multimedia","specialised beat","published portfolio."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"Key principle","text":"A journalist's strongest asset is credibility. Excellent writing is important, but long-term success depends on finding original information, verifying it rigorously, understanding context, protecting source integrity and communicating the truth clearly and responsibly."}]}]}